    <section xml:id="sec-section-6-1">
      <title>Section 43 - Iterated Integrals and Properties of Double Integrals</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Evaluate a double integral over a rectangular region by writing it as an iterated integral.
    </li>
    <li>
      Evaluate a double integral over a rectangular region by reversing the order of integration.
    </li>
    <li>
      Recognize and use some of the properties of double integrals.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

      <p>[Placeholder]</p>
